{"slug": "C_S02E24", "video_name": "Community - S02E24 - For a Few Paintballs More (2) Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E24 - For a Few Paintballs More (2) Bluray-1080p Proper.en.srt", "duration_seconds": 1226.773, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 457, "segments": [{"start": 4.83306, "end": 5.83306, "text": "Dean!"}, {"start": 5.83306, "end": 6.83306, "text": "Dean!"}, {"start": 6.83306, "end": 8.83306, "text": "Don't shoot, red-haired guy."}, {"start": 8.83306, "end": 9.188615555555556, "text": "Why not?"}, {"start": 9.188615555555556, "end": 10.83306, "text": "Something's not right about the game."}, {"start": 10.83306, "end": 13.83306, "text": "We just took out a guy who turned out to be a professional paintball assassin."}, {"start": 13.83306, "end": 15.83306, "text": "A professional?"}, {"start": 15.83306, "end": 17.83306, "text": "That doesn't make sense."}, {"start": 17.83306, "end": 20.83306, "text": "Why would someone who gets paid to do things be at Greendale?"}, {"start": 22.83306, "end": 23.12574292682927, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 23.12574292682927, "end": 23.418425853658537, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 23.418425853658537, "end": 23.711108780487805, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 23.711108780487805, "end": 25.272084390243904, "text": "I'm not playing!"}, {"start": 25.272084390243904, "end": 26.83306, "text": "I'm not playing!"}, {"start": 26.83306, "end": 27.20806, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 27.20806, "end": 28.83306, "text": "I'm the Dean!"}, {"start": 28.83306, "end": 30.83306, "text": "They're hurting me!"}, {"start": 30.83306, "end": 32.83306, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 35.83306, "end": 37.83306, "text": "Hi, Pistol Patty."}, {"start": 37.83306, "end": 39.83306, "text": "Did they take you hostage?"}, {"start": 43.83306, "end": 45.83306, "text": "Dean Sprech?"}, {"start": 45.83306, "end": 47.83306, "text": "Hello, Craig."}, {"start": 47.83306, "end": 49.83306, "text": "City College."}, {"start": 49.83306, "end": 51.456248405797105, "text": "Now I understand everything."}, {"start": 51.456248405797105, "end": 53.83306, "text": "Now your whole evil plan is clear as day."}, {"start": 55.83306, "end": 58.83306, "text": "But if you need to explain it to your men, I understand."}, {"start": 58.83306, "end": 60.24046740740741, "text": "It's simple, Craig."}, {"start": 60.24046740740741, "end": 62.83306, "text": "I pose as a fake ice cream company."}, {"start": 62.83306, "end": 65.83306, "text": "Sponsor your end-of-the-year picnic"}, {"start": 65.83306, "end": 68.83306, "text": "and waive enough money under your students' noses"}, {"start": 68.83306, "end": 71.83306, "text": "to provoke them to destroy their own campus."}, {"start": 71.83306, "end": 73.83306, "text": "Who hurt you, Steven?"}, {"start": 73.83306, "end": 76.83306, "text": "How could any Dean be so mean?"}, {"start": 76.83306, "end": 82.83306, "text": "Oh, you haven't seen how mean this Dean can be."}, {"start": 82.83306, "end": 84.83306, "text": "There's one."}, {"start": 90.83306, "end": 92.83306, "text": "Wait, did you say \"Bean\"?"}, {"start": 108.83306, "end": 110.33306, "text": "Gus!"}, {"start": 110.33306, "end": 111.83306, "text": "Gus!"}, {"start": 111.83306, "end": 113.83306, "text": "City College is trying to destroy Greendale,"}, {"start": 113.83306, "end": 116.83306, "text": "and they're an unstoppable juggernaut."}, {"start": 116.83306, "end": 118.83306, "text": "Which means, if we're going to fight them,"}, {"start": 118.83306, "end": 121.83306, "text": "we have to form a schoolwide alliance of rebels."}, {"start": 121.83306, "end": 123.83306, "text": "In other words, it seems we've left the Western motif"}, {"start": 123.83306, "end": 125.83306, "text": "and entering more of a Star Wars scenario."}, {"start": 125.83306, "end": 126.21143837837838, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 126.21143837837838, "end": 127.83306, "text": "I wish it happened sooner too."}, {"start": 127.83306, "end": 130.83306, "text": "But if we surrender our individuality to form a faceless regime,"}, {"start": 130.83306, "end": 132.7922436734694, "text": "how are we any better than them?"}, {"start": 132.7922436734694, "end": 133.83306, "text": "You're the worst."}, {"start": 133.83306, "end": 135.83306, "text": "Okay, she is just saying that to fit in."}, {"start": 135.83306, "end": 137.83306, "text": "The floor recognizes magnitude."}, {"start": 137.83306, "end": 139.83306, "text": "First off, Pop Pop."}, {"start": 141.83306, "end": 143.83306, "text": "And second, magnitude's a one-man party,"}, {"start": 143.83306, "end": 145.83306, "text": "a one-man party can't be an alliance."}, {"start": 145.83306, "end": 146.83306, "text": "That's a paradox."}, {"start": 146.83306, "end": 147.59496476190475, "text": "I agree."}, {"start": 147.59496476190475, "end": 148.83306, "text": "Two disagree."}, {"start": 148.83306, "end": 149.58981675675673, "text": "Easy, paradox."}, {"start": 149.58981675675673, "end": 150.83306, "text": "We're on the same side."}, {"start": 150.83306, "end": 152.83306, "text": "But it hasn't the other side already won."}, {"start": 152.83306, "end": 154.83306, "text": "Their goal was to make us trash the school."}, {"start": 154.83306, "end": 155.83306, "text": "We trashed it."}, {"start": 155.83306, "end": 157.83306, "text": "Yeah, but we still might have a chance to hit 'em where it hurts."}, {"start": 157.83306, "end": 158.83306, "text": "They're balls?"}, {"start": 158.83306, "end": 159.83306, "text": "No."}, {"start": 159.83306, "end": 160.83306, "text": "Just below their balls?"}, {"start": 160.83306, "end": 161.83306, "text": "They're wallet, Leonard."}, {"start": 161.83306, "end": 163.83306, "text": "I think it's called a taint."}, {"start": 163.83306, "end": 165.83306, "text": "Why do you think they sent in a ringer to win?"}, {"start": 165.83306, "end": 169.83306, "text": "It must be because we're entitled to the prize they promised."}, {"start": 169.83306, "end": 170.83306, "text": "A hundred Gs."}, {"start": 170.83306, "end": 171.83306, "text": "Ooh, I could use that money."}, {"start": 171.83306, "end": 173.83306, "text": "This is why we have to agree right now"}, {"start": 173.83306, "end": 177.83306, "text": "that whoever wins, we give the money to Greendale."}, {"start": 177.83306, "end": 179.83306, "text": "To repair the damage and save our school."}, {"start": 179.83306, "end": 180.83306, "text": "Abed, tell 'em."}, {"start": 180.83306, "end": 181.83306, "text": "Whatever, pal."}, {"start": 181.83306, "end": 182.83306, "text": "I ain't in it for your revolution."}, {"start": 182.83306, "end": 183.83306, "text": "I'm in it for me."}, {"start": 183.83306, "end": 184.16639333333333, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 184.16639333333333, "end": 185.83306, "text": "Abed, this was your idea."}, {"start": 185.83306, "end": 187.83306, "text": "I know, but I'm calling Dibs on the Han Solo role"}, {"start": 187.83306, "end": 189.83306, "text": "before Jeff sloshes into it by default."}, {"start": 189.83306, "end": 190.83306, "text": "Starburns, I need that vest."}, {"start": 190.83306, "end": 191.83306, "text": "Oh, yeah, right."}, {"start": 191.83306, "end": 193.83306, "text": "Give me the vest, laser breath."}, {"start": 193.83306, "end": 195.83306, "text": "Before our conversation gets nasty."}, {"start": 198.83306, "end": 200.83306, "text": "Question, how long is the game gonna last?"}, {"start": 200.83306, "end": 202.83306, "text": "'Cause Andre's home with the baby."}, {"start": 202.83306, "end": 203.83306, "text": "Damn it, Shirley!"}, {"start": 203.83306, "end": 204.83306, "text": "Forget your newborn child"}, {"start": 204.83306, "end": 206.83306, "text": "and think about the people that need you."}, {"start": 206.83306, "end": 208.83306, "text": "I can't afford to lose a single soldier."}, {"start": 208.83306, "end": 210.83306, "text": "Oh, now you're the leader?"}, {"start": 210.83306, "end": 211.83306, "text": "I don't see you stepping up."}, {"start": 211.83306, "end": 213.83306, "text": "I don't step up to being leader, Troy."}, {"start": 213.83306, "end": 216.83306, "text": "I reluctantly accept it when it's thrust upon me."}, {"start": 216.83306, "end": 217.83306, "text": "Oh, Jeff."}, {"start": 218.83306, "end": 219.83306, "text": "Oh, my God!"}, {"start": 219.83306, "end": 220.83306, "text": "What a mess!"}, {"start": 220.83306, "end": 223.83306, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 232.83306, "end": 236.83306, "text": "[sobbing]"}, {"start": 236.83306, "end": 239.83306, "text": "[sobbing]"}, {"start": 239.83306, "end": 240.83306, "text": "Pop."}, {"start": 240.83306, "end": 241.83306, "text": "Pop what?"}, {"start": 241.83306, "end": 242.83306, "text": "Pop what?"}, {"start": 242.83306, "end": 243.83306, "text": "What is he trying to say?"}, {"start": 243.83306, "end": 245.83306, "text": "Pop what magnitude?"}, {"start": 248.83306, "end": 249.83306, "text": "Can you hear me?"}, {"start": 249.83306, "end": 250.83306, "text": "Who is this?"}, {"start": 250.83306, "end": 252.83306, "text": "Oh, that's Jeff Winger."}, {"start": 252.83306, "end": 254.83306, "text": "You are in trouble now."}, {"start": 254.83306, "end": 255.83306, "text": "Jeopardy, it's your friend the Dean."}, {"start": 255.83306, "end": 256.83306, "text": "I'm safe."}, {"start": 256.83306, "end": 258.83306, "text": "[grunting]"}, {"start": 258.83306, "end": 260.29459846153844, "text": "I can hear you, Mr."}, {"start": 260.29459846153844, "end": 260.83306, "text": "Winger."}, {"start": 260.83306, "end": 263.83306, "text": "This is City College's Dean Sprech."}, {"start": 263.83306, "end": 264.83306, "text": "Hey, Sprech!"}, {"start": 264.83306, "end": 265.83306, "text": "You cheat."}, {"start": 265.83306, "end": 267.83306, "text": "You can't spray people with paint by remote."}, {"start": 267.83306, "end": 270.83306, "text": "And you can't have City College students in a Greendale game."}, {"start": 270.83306, "end": 273.83306, "text": "All my men have been registered at Greendale for weeks."}, {"start": 273.83306, "end": 276.83306, "text": "As for rules, they're clearly defined in your school's agreement"}, {"start": 276.83306, "end": 278.83306, "text": "with my fake ice cream company."}, {"start": 278.83306, "end": 281.83306, "text": "If you get paint on you, you're out."}, {"start": 281.83306, "end": 283.83306, "text": "Well, I'm glad to see there's paperwork involved."}, {"start": 283.83306, "end": 284.83306, "text": "Because we are going to win."}, {"start": 284.83306, "end": 286.83306, "text": "And you're going to pay."}, {"start": 286.83306, "end": 287.30364823529413, "text": "Yay!"}, {"start": 287.30364823529413, "end": 290.83306, "text": "Go, Jeff Winger's study group."}, {"start": 290.83306, "end": 292.83306, "text": "Those guys are ballers, Joe."}, {"start": 292.83306, "end": 295.83306, "text": "I hope you like getting bald."}, {"start": 295.83306, "end": 298.83306, "text": "Sir, this guy tried to charge us three paintballs"}, {"start": 298.83306, "end": 300.83306, "text": "to use the bathroom."}, {"start": 300.83306, "end": 303.83306, "text": "We were going to shoot him, but tell him what you told us."}, {"start": 303.83306, "end": 304.83306, "text": "Don't shoot me."}, {"start": 304.83306, "end": 305.43306, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 305.43306, "end": 306.83306, "text": "Now shoot him."}, {"start": 306.83306, "end": 308.83306, "text": "Sure, shoot me."}, {"start": 308.83306, "end": 311.83306, "text": "You'd certainly be doing Jeff Winger a big favor."}, {"start": 313.83306, "end": 314.83306, "text": "Greendale human beings."}, {"start": 314.83306, "end": 318.83306, "text": "It is now clear that we have no choice but to team up"}, {"start": 318.83306, "end": 320.83306, "text": "and defeat City College."}, {"start": 320.83306, "end": 323.83306, "text": "I also have no choice but to accept the role thrust upon me."}, {"start": 323.83306, "end": 325.83306, "text": "In what role would that be?"}, {"start": 325.83306, "end": 326.83306, "text": "No time to squabble, Troy."}, {"start": 326.83306, "end": 328.83306, "text": "For Greendale on three."}, {"start": 328.83306, "end": 329.83306, "text": "One."}, {"start": 329.83306, "end": 330.83306, "text": "Two."}, {"start": 330.83306, "end": 331.83306, "text": "Jeff, every second counts."}, {"start": 331.83306, "end": 332.83306, "text": "For Greendale on two."}, {"start": 332.83306, "end": 333.83306, "text": "One."}, {"start": 333.83306, "end": 334.83306, "text": "Guys."}, {"start": 334.83306, "end": 335.83306, "text": "Four."}, {"start": 335.83306, "end": 336.83306, "text": "Greendale."}, {"start": 336.83306, "end": 338.83306, "text": "For Greendale."}, {"start": 341.83306, "end": 343.83306, "text": "Greendale students."}, {"start": 343.83306, "end": 345.83306, "text": "I understand you've unified."}, {"start": 345.83306, "end": 348.83306, "text": "And intend to draw this game out."}, {"start": 348.83306, "end": 352.83306, "text": "Well, if it's a war you want, it's a war you will lose."}, {"start": 352.83306, "end": 354.83306, "text": "City College is stronger."}, {"start": 354.83306, "end": 355.83306, "text": "Faster."}, {"start": 355.83306, "end": 357.83306, "text": "Our sperm counts are higher."}, {"start": 357.83306, "end": 359.83306, "text": "Even in our women."}, {"start": 359.83306, "end": 362.83306, "text": "Resistance is as pointless as your degrees."}, {"start": 362.83306, "end": 367.83306, "text": "Honestly, ask yourself, what does liberal arts even mean?"}, {"start": 368.83306, "end": 369.83306, "text": "Welcome to Greendale."}, {"start": 369.83306, "end": 370.83306, "text": "You're already accepted."}, {"start": 370.83306, "end": 371.83306, "text": "Losers."}, {"start": 372.83306, "end": 373.83306, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 375.83306, "end": 376.83306, "text": "Welcome to Greendale."}, {"start": 376.83306, "end": 377.83306, "text": "You're already dead."}, {"start": 382.83306, "end": 383.83306, "text": "Jackpot."}, {"start": 383.83306, "end": 384.83306, "text": "Shirley."}, {"start": 384.83306, "end": 385.83306, "text": "You keep watch while we get these."}, {"start": 390.83306, "end": 391.83306, "text": "Here, help me with this."}, {"start": 391.83306, "end": 392.83306, "text": "Sure thing, Your Worship."}, {"start": 392.83306, "end": 394.83306, "text": "Abed, stop trying to be Han Solo."}, {"start": 394.83306, "end": 396.83306, "text": "It's making me embarrassed for you."}, {"start": 397.83306, "end": 398.83306, "text": "Come on, admit it."}, {"start": 398.83306, "end": 399.83306, "text": "You like it."}, {"start": 399.83306, "end": 401.83306, "text": "I like having conversations with adults."}, {"start": 401.83306, "end": 403.83306, "text": "Playing Star Wars is worn out and immature."}, {"start": 403.83306, "end": 405.83306, "text": "You like me because I'm immature."}, {"start": 406.83306, "end": 408.83306, "text": "There's not enough immaturity in your life."}, {"start": 410.83306, "end": 412.83306, "text": "I hope I don't get shot waiting out here."}, {"start": 412.83306, "end": 414.83306, "text": "I'd hate to go home to my babies."}, {"start": 417.83306, "end": 420.83306, "text": "So reconnaissance indicates the key to City College's strategy"}, {"start": 420.83306, "end": 423.83306, "text": "is the Gatling gun inside the ice cream truck,"}, {"start": 423.83306, "end": 426.83306, "text": "which we will charge en masse, overwhelming their defenses,"}, {"start": 426.83306, "end": 428.83306, "text": "and taking that gun for ourselves."}, {"start": 428.83306, "end": 430.83306, "text": "Well, that's not how I would proceed."}, {"start": 430.83306, "end": 432.83306, "text": "Troy, do you happen to have a better plan?"}, {"start": 432.83306, "end": 433.83306, "text": "I do happen, Jeff."}, {"start": 433.83306, "end": 435.83306, "text": "I happen very much."}, {"start": 436.83306, "end": 439.83306, "text": "We use sneak attacks to draw their patrols to the library,"}, {"start": 439.83306, "end": 441.83306, "text": "where one of us will pull the fire alarm,"}, {"start": 441.83306, "end": 442.83306, "text": "activating the sprinklers,"}, {"start": 442.83306, "end": 445.83306, "text": "which I will have rigged using my super plumbing skills,"}, {"start": 445.83306, "end": 447.83306, "text": "to shower everything in the building with paint."}, {"start": 447.83306, "end": 449.83306, "text": "Paint in sprinklers?"}, {"start": 449.83306, "end": 450.83306, "text": "Are we the little rascals?"}, {"start": 450.83306, "end": 451.83306, "text": "I was."}, {"start": 451.83306, "end": 452.83306, "text": "Have you heard your plan?"}, {"start": 452.83306, "end": 454.83306, "text": "You want to charge a machine gun."}, {"start": 461.83306, "end": 462.83306, "text": "I've got something to say."}, {"start": 462.83306, "end": 465.83306, "text": "I don't take orders from girls, because they don't talk to me."}, {"start": 465.83306, "end": 467.83306, "text": "Watch it, Quasar Face."}, {"start": 467.83306, "end": 469.83306, "text": "And he's a good kid and a better shot."}, {"start": 469.83306, "end": 472.83306, "text": "So listen up, or you'll be floating home."}, {"start": 472.83306, "end": 474.2876054545454, "text": "Thank you, Abed?"}, {"start": 474.2876054545454, "end": 474.83306, "text": "Sorry."}, {"start": 475.83306, "end": 476.83306, "text": "Hon."}, {"start": 477.83306, "end": 478.83306, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 478.83306, "end": 480.83306, "text": "I think we should split the troops in half"}, {"start": 480.83306, "end": 482.83306, "text": "and carry out both plans simultaneously."}, {"start": 482.83306, "end": 485.83306, "text": "Troy, your plan will lure people off the ice cream truck,"}, {"start": 485.83306, "end": 487.83306, "text": "allowing Jeff's troops to take the stronghold."}, {"start": 489.83306, "end": 490.83306, "text": "You're welcome."}, {"start": 490.83306, "end": 492.83306, "text": "I'm so glad that we didn't shoot you."}, {"start": 492.83306, "end": 494.83306, "text": "Now we have the tactical advantage"}, {"start": 494.83306, "end": 497.83306, "text": "of knowing that Jeff Winger wants to be a ballerina,"}, {"start": 497.83306, "end": 501.03306, "text": "and that his achilles heel is..."}, {"start": 501.03306, "end": 501.83306, "text": "weiners."}, {"start": 501.83306, "end": 503.83306, "text": "That's just the tip of the iceberg."}, {"start": 503.83306, "end": 506.83306, "text": "For one more pudding, I'll tell you why he's jealous of me."}, {"start": 506.83306, "end": 508.83306, "text": "And you say that they kicked you out of their study group"}, {"start": 508.83306, "end": 509.83306, "text": "after two years?"}, {"start": 509.83306, "end": 510.83306, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 510.83306, "end": 512.83306, "text": "What took them so long?"}, {"start": 519.7839999999999, "end": 522.7839999999999, "text": "Hey, thanks for sticking up for me back there."}, {"start": 522.7839999999999, "end": 525.7839999999999, "text": "This group gets so tangled in each other's feelings,"}, {"start": 525.7839999999999, "end": 527.7839999999999, "text": "you're kind of a hero for standing outside of it."}, {"start": 527.7839999999999, "end": 530.7839999999999, "text": "Well, heroes are great, but I'll take a blaster every time."}, {"start": 530.7839999999999, "end": 533.7839999999999, "text": "Anyway, just wanted to let you know,"}, {"start": 533.7839999999999, "end": 535.7839999999999, "text": "I don't think you're immature."}, {"start": 535.7839999999999, "end": 537.7839999999999, "text": "I think you're great..."}, {"start": 538.7839999999999, "end": 543.7839999999999, "text": "for a no-good, laser-faced, jabba scoundrel."}, {"start": 543.7839999999999, "end": 545.3294545454544, "text": "You're good, kid."}, {"start": 545.3294545454544, "end": 546.7839999999999, "text": "Don't get cocky."}, {"start": 551.7839999999999, "end": 552.7839999999999, "text": "Hey!"}, {"start": 552.7839999999999, "end": 553.2839999999999, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 553.2839999999999, "end": 553.7839999999999, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 553.7839999999999, "end": 555.7839999999999, "text": "Hey!"}, {"start": 560.7839999999999, "end": 562.7839999999999, "text": "They're right on our tail."}, {"start": 562.7839999999999, "end": 564.7839999999999, "text": "Operation Troy's awesome plane is living up to its name."}, {"start": 564.7839999999999, "end": 566.7839999999999, "text": "All good for you."}, {"start": 567.7839999999999, "end": 569.7839999999999, "text": "Looks like they're taking Troy's bait."}, {"start": 569.7839999999999, "end": 572.7839999999999, "text": "Squad B, commencing operation, actual operation."}, {"start": 572.7839999999999, "end": 573.7839999999999, "text": "Everyone look alive."}, {"start": 573.7839999999999, "end": 575.7839999999999, "text": "Leonard, good enough."}, {"start": 575.7839999999999, "end": 578.7839999999999, "text": "Greendell, it's been a pleasure fighting with you."}, {"start": 578.7839999999999, "end": 580.7839999999999, "text": "Some of us won't make it."}, {"start": 580.7839999999999, "end": 582.7839999999999, "text": "But there is a place where we will all see each other again."}, {"start": 582.7839999999999, "end": 584.7839999999999, "text": "And that place is Denny's."}, {"start": 584.7839999999999, "end": 585.7839999999999, "text": "Which Denny's?"}, {"start": 585.7839999999999, "end": 586.7839999999999, "text": "We'll figure it out later, Donner."}, {"start": 586.7839999999999, "end": 588.7839999999999, "text": "The one near the 15th exit, I'm banned from there."}, {"start": 588.7839999999999, "end": 589.7839999999999, "text": "Well, then I guess I'll see you in hell."}, {"start": 589.7839999999999, "end": 591.7839999999999, "text": "Then let's kick some tape, okay?"}, {"start": 591.7839999999999, "end": 593.7839999999999, "text": "On my count!"}, {"start": 593.7839999999999, "end": 594.7839999999999, "text": "One!"}, {"start": 594.7839999999999, "end": 595.7839999999999, "text": "Two!"}, {"start": 595.7839999999999, "end": 598.7839999999999, "text": "Dickie!"}, {"start": 613.404, "end": 614.404, "text": "Go, go, go, go!"}, {"start": 614.404, "end": 615.404, "text": "Come back to the door."}, {"start": 615.404, "end": 617.404, "text": "I'm going to seal the road."}, {"start": 617.404, "end": 618.404, "text": "Alright."}, {"start": 618.404, "end": 620.404, "text": "Shirley, you have the most important job, okay?"}, {"start": 620.404, "end": 621.404, "text": "Yeah, yeah, pull the fire alarm."}, {"start": 621.404, "end": 622.404, "text": "Can we move this along?"}, {"start": 622.404, "end": 623.404, "text": "I'm missing CSI."}, {"start": 623.404, "end": 624.404, "text": "Enemy soldiers are incoming."}, {"start": 624.404, "end": 626.404, "text": "I need everyone to evacuate through the air."}, {"start": 626.404, "end": 627.404, "text": "Va--"}, {"start": 628.404, "end": 629.404, "text": "Garrett!"}, {"start": 629.404, "end": 631.404, "text": "I may be stuck in this van."}, {"start": 631.404, "end": 632.404, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 632.404, "end": 633.404, "text": "It is too early to tell."}, {"start": 643.404, "end": 648.1494545454545, "text": "I think our only choice is to"}, {"start": 648.1494545454545, "end": 652.404, "text": "try and shoot our way out."}, {"start": 652.404, "end": 653.404, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 653.404, "end": 657.404, "text": "Commence, operation, choice, awesome leadership is never in doubt."}, {"start": 670.404, "end": 671.404, "text": "That's affirmative."}, {"start": 673.404, "end": 674.404, "text": "That gun's too powerful."}, {"start": 674.404, "end": 676.404, "text": "I'm scared."}, {"start": 677.404, "end": 678.404, "text": "Kendra with a QU."}, {"start": 679.404, "end": 680.404, "text": "They can kill most of us."}, {"start": 680.404, "end": 684.404, "text": "But as long as we know what he gives up, somebody won't make it through."}, {"start": 684.404, "end": 685.404, "text": "Understand?"}, {"start": 685.404, "end": 686.404, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 687.404, "end": 690.404, "text": "Charge!"}, {"start": 691.404, "end": 692.404, "text": "Well, I'm out."}, {"start": 692.404, "end": 693.404, "text": "We lost."}, {"start": 693.404, "end": 694.404, "text": "See you, Denny's."}, {"start": 694.404, "end": 696.404, "text": "Denny's is for winners."}, {"start": 697.404, "end": 699.404, "text": "We've got two of us being trapped outside the library."}, {"start": 700.404, "end": 701.654, "text": "Keep them down."}, {"start": 701.654, "end": 703.404, "text": "They won't fall down."}, {"start": 714.404, "end": 715.404, "text": "Leonard, we're losing."}, {"start": 715.404, "end": 718.404, "text": "Britta, I've been in a few real wars."}, {"start": 718.404, "end": 721.404, "text": "But this one is actually the most terrifying."}, {"start": 721.404, "end": 723.404, "text": "Guys, we're dying out here."}, {"start": 723.404, "end": 725.404, "text": "Well, we're dying too."}, {"start": 725.404, "end": 727.404, "text": "They trapped us in a dead end."}, {"start": 727.404, "end": 728.404, "text": "Hey, kid."}, {"start": 729.404, "end": 731.404, "text": "Someone's got to make it out of here alive."}, {"start": 747.404, "end": 749.404, "text": "I had a dream it would end this way."}, {"start": 755.404, "end": 757.404, "text": "Shirley, nobody's making it out of the library."}, {"start": 757.404, "end": 758.404, "text": "Pull the alarm."}, {"start": 758.404, "end": 759.404, "text": "Britta?"}, {"start": 759.404, "end": 760.404, "text": "Are you alive?"}, {"start": 760.404, "end": 761.404, "text": "Britta?"}, {"start": 761.404, "end": 762.404, "text": "Britta?"}, {"start": 764.404, "end": 765.404, "text": "Oh, hell."}, {"start": 765.404, "end": 767.404, "text": "Someone's got to win this."}, {"start": 775.404, "end": 776.404, "text": "I'm out."}, {"start": 776.404, "end": 777.404, "text": "Me too."}, {"start": 777.404, "end": 779.404, "text": "Alpha-17, move in."}, {"start": 781.404, "end": 783.404, "text": "Looks like this is it."}, {"start": 783.404, "end": 785.404, "text": "Will you still be Han Solo after we die?"}, {"start": 785.404, "end": 786.6479024390244, "text": "Afraid not, doll."}, {"start": 786.6479024390244, "end": 788.404, "text": "Once I'm gone, I'm gone."}, {"start": 788.404, "end": 789.404, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 790.404, "end": 791.404, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 797.404, "end": 799.404, "text": "I've got to do everything myself."}, {"start": 815.404, "end": 820.804, "text": "We're all"}, {"start": 820.804, "end": 823.804, "text": "dead."}, {"start": 823.804, "end": 829.404, "text": "All of us."}, {"start": 829.404, "end": 831.404, "text": "Pain is raining from the sky."}, {"start": 831.404, "end": 833.404, "text": "Everyone in the library is dead."}, {"start": 833.404, "end": 834.404, "text": "Damn it."}, {"start": 839.404, "end": 840.404, "text": "Kill him."}, {"start": 840.404, "end": 841.404, "text": "Yes, sir."}, {"start": 846.404, "end": 847.404, "text": "My heart."}, {"start": 849.404, "end": 850.404, "text": "Buddy, you okay?"}, {"start": 855.404, "end": 856.404, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 861.404, "end": 866.404, "text": "Put the heat in your storm of Troop and city college nub gobblers."}, {"start": 869.404, "end": 870.404, "text": "You're it, kid."}, {"start": 872.404, "end": 873.404, "text": "Covering the right flank."}, {"start": 875.404, "end": 876.404, "text": "Okay, looks like we got him."}, {"start": 891.2310000000001, "end": 892.2310000000001, "text": "Shirley!"}, {"start": 893.2310000000001, "end": 894.2310000000001, "text": "What are we supposed to do?"}, {"start": 894.2310000000001, "end": 896.2310000000001, "text": "How about we save this school's ass?"}, {"start": 897.2310000000001, "end": 898.2310000000001, "text": "Deal."}, {"start": 902.2310000000001, "end": 903.2310000000001, "text": "Go, go, go, go!"}, {"start": 910.2310000000001, "end": 911.2310000000001, "text": "Hold on!"}, {"start": 925.2310000000001, "end": 926.2310000000001, "text": "Watch it!"}, {"start": 930.2310000000001, "end": 931.2310000000001, "text": "Is that it?"}, {"start": 931.2310000000001, "end": 932.2310000000001, "text": "Is that it?"}, {"start": 932.2310000000001, "end": 933.2310000000001, "text": "We win?"}, {"start": 933.2310000000001, "end": 934.2310000000001, "text": "We win!"}, {"start": 934.2310000000001, "end": 935.2310000000001, "text": "Oh, we win!"}, {"start": 936.2310000000001, "end": 937.2310000000001, "text": "Jeopardy!"}, {"start": 940.2310000000001, "end": 941.2310000000001, "text": "Woo-hoo!"}, {"start": 943.2310000000001, "end": 944.2310000000001, "text": "We win."}, {"start": 944.2310000000001, "end": 945.2310000000001, "text": "You win."}, {"start": 945.2310000000001, "end": 946.2310000000001, "text": "Yes!"}, {"start": 947.2310000000001, "end": 948.2310000000001, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 949.2310000000001, "end": 950.2310000000001, "text": "Way to shoot."}, {"start": 950.2310000000001, "end": 952.2310000000001, "text": "All right, we did it!"}, {"start": 952.2310000000001, "end": 953.2310000000001, "text": "Yeah, way to shoot."}, {"start": 953.2310000000001, "end": 954.2310000000001, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 954.2310000000001, "end": 955.2310000000001, "text": "Who are you?"}, {"start": 955.2310000000001, "end": 956.2310000000001, "text": "Your mother's lover."}, {"start": 957.2310000000001, "end": 958.2310000000001, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 959.2310000000001, "end": 960.2310000000001, "text": "Oh, man."}, {"start": 960.2310000000001, "end": 961.2310000000001, "text": "I win!"}, {"start": 964.2310000000001, "end": 965.2310000000001, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 966.2310000000001, "end": 968.2310000000001, "text": "You owe me a hundred jeans."}, {"start": 969.2310000000001, "end": 971.2310000000001, "text": "And you can make the check out..."}, {"start": 972.2310000000001, "end": 973.2310000000001, "text": "to green dirt."}, {"start": 974.2310000000001, "end": 975.2310000000001, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 976.2310000000001, "end": 977.2310000000001, "text": "Yes!"}, {"start": 978.2310000000001, "end": 979.2310000000001, "text": "U-F-E!"}, {"start": 979.2310000000001, "end": 980.2310000000001, "text": "U-F-E!"}, {"start": 981.2310000000001, "end": 982.4810000000001, "text": "U-F-E!"}, {"start": 982.4810000000001, "end": 983.7310000000001, "text": "U-F-E!"}, {"start": 983.7310000000001, "end": 984.9810000000001, "text": "U-F-E!"}, {"start": 984.9810000000001, "end": 986.2310000000001, "text": "U-F-E!"}, {"start": 987.2310000000001, "end": 992.2310000000001, "text": "[♪♪♪]"}, {"start": 993.2310000000001, "end": 994.2310000000001, "text": "[laughing]"}, {"start": 997.2310000000001, "end": 998.2310000000001, "text": "Hi, baby."}, {"start": 1000.2310000000001, "end": 1004.2310000000001, "text": "Okay, final meeting of the semester, now in session."}, {"start": 1004.2310000000001, "end": 1005.2310000000001, "text": "Final order of business."}, {"start": 1005.2310000000001, "end": 1007.2310000000001, "text": "Pick a class we can all take in the fall."}, {"start": 1007.2310000000001, "end": 1009.2310000000001, "text": "We could just take Anthro 201."}, {"start": 1009.2310000000001, "end": 1010.2310000000001, "text": "Too risky."}, {"start": 1010.2310000000001, "end": 1011.2310000000001, "text": "Sequels are almost always disappointing."}, {"start": 1011.2310000000001, "end": 1014.2310000000001, "text": "Since when are you in favor of playing it safe, Han?"}, {"start": 1015.2310000000001, "end": 1016.2310000000001, "text": "Cool down, Annie."}, {"start": 1016.2310000000001, "end": 1018.2310000000001, "text": "I was only Han Solo because the context demanded it."}, {"start": 1018.2310000000001, "end": 1019.2310000000001, "text": "But here."}, {"start": 1023.2310000000001, "end": 1024.2310000000002, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 1024.2310000000002, "end": 1025.2310000000002, "text": "Starburns."}, {"start": 1025.2310000000002, "end": 1027.2310000000002, "text": "Yeah, he's just some kind of crystal instead of deodorant."}, {"start": 1027.2310000000002, "end": 1028.2310000000002, "text": "Guys, I know exactly what we should do."}, {"start": 1029.2310000000002, "end": 1032.2310000000002, "text": "We should see what Troy thinks we should do."}, {"start": 1033.2310000000002, "end": 1034.2310000000002, "text": "He had some good ideas today."}, {"start": 1034.2310000000002, "end": 1035.2310000000002, "text": "Thanks, man."}, {"start": 1035.2310000000002, "end": 1036.2310000000002, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 1039.788, "end": 1043.788, "text": "I've given this a lot of thought, and I've decided we should sleep on it."}, {"start": 1044.788, "end": 1046.788, "text": "Just came back for my day planner."}, {"start": 1047.788, "end": 1048.788, "text": "Pretend I'm not even here."}, {"start": 1048.788, "end": 1050.788, "text": "You guys are great at that."}, {"start": 1050.788, "end": 1054.788, "text": "Come on, Pierce, we all know there is no day planner."}, {"start": 1054.788, "end": 1055.788, "text": "Here it is."}, {"start": 1055.788, "end": 1057.9512653061224, "text": "Now, if you'll excuse me, it appears I'm running late"}, {"start": 1057.9512653061224, "end": 1059.788, "text": "to drink a bottle of wine in my bathing suit."}, {"start": 1059.788, "end": 1061.788, "text": "Pierce, wait."}, {"start": 1065.788, "end": 1067.788, "text": "You know, I've been coming to this school for 12 years."}, {"start": 1069.788, "end": 1073.788, "text": "I've never been friends with anyone here more than a semester."}, {"start": 1074.788, "end": 1077.788, "text": "Probably for the same reason I've been married seven times."}, {"start": 1077.788, "end": 1082.0737142857142, "text": "I guess I assume eventually I'll be rejected,"}, {"start": 1082.0737142857142, "end": 1085.788, "text": "so I, you know, test people, push them."}, {"start": 1085.788, "end": 1087.788, "text": "Until they prove me right."}, {"start": 1087.788, "end": 1090.8713333333333, "text": "It's a sickness, I admit it, but this"}, {"start": 1090.8713333333333, "end": 1094.788, "text": "place has always accepted me, sickness and all."}, {"start": 1094.788, "end": 1098.788, "text": "This place accepted all of you, sickness and all."}, {"start": 1098.788, "end": 1099.788, "text": "It's worth thinking about."}, {"start": 1101.788, "end": 1104.788, "text": "I think we have thought about it, Pierce, and you're right."}, {"start": 1105.788, "end": 1109.324842105263, "text": "And we were just picking a class we could all be"}, {"start": 1109.324842105263, "end": 1112.788, "text": "in this fall, and we'd love for you to join us."}, {"start": 1112.788, "end": 1113.788, "text": "No, thanks."}, {"start": 1117.338, "end": 1118.338, "text": "I'm done with you guys."}, {"start": 1119.338, "end": 1122.338, "text": "I like this school, but I'm done with whatever you call this."}, {"start": 1122.338, "end": 1123.338, "text": "Adios."}, {"start": 1123.338, "end": 1124.338, "text": "He was my ride?"}, {"start": 1124.338, "end": 1125.338, "text": "I'm going after him."}, {"start": 1128.412, "end": 1129.412, "text": "No, he's just acting out."}, {"start": 1129.412, "end": 1131.412, "text": "I've seen this behavior before."}, {"start": 1132.412, "end": 1133.412, "text": "In cats."}, {"start": 1134.412, "end": 1135.412, "text": "My, my cats."}, {"start": 1135.412, "end": 1136.412, "text": "It's true."}, {"start": 1136.412, "end": 1140.739868852459, "text": "And now, he'll come slinking back"}, {"start": 1140.739868852459, "end": 1144.412, "text": "in five, four, three, two..."}, {"start": 1172.0439999999999, "end": 1175.0439999999999, "text": "And then one of the stormtroopers shot the others, and it was Pierce."}, {"start": 1180.5259999999998, "end": 1182.5259999999998, "text": "And we won."}, {"start": 1182.5259999999998, "end": 1183.5259999999998, "text": "We saved Greendale."}, {"start": 1183.5259999999998, "end": 1185.5259999999998, "text": "Sounds like you guys had a lot of fun."}, {"start": 1185.5259999999998, "end": 1186.5259999999998, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 1186.5259999999998, "end": 1188.5259999999998, "text": "Honestly, I don't know how we're going to top it next year."}, {"start": 1188.5259999999998, "end": 1189.5259999999998, "text": "Oh, I got a pitch."}, {"start": 1189.5259999999998, "end": 1190.5259999999998, "text": "Why use guns?"}, {"start": 1190.5259999999998, "end": 1192.5259999999998, "text": "Take a hose and spray the whole school with paint."}, {"start": 1192.5259999999998, "end": 1193.5259999999998, "text": "Every inch of it."}, {"start": 1193.5259999999998, "end": 1194.5259999999998, "text": "Actually, we kind of did that."}, {"start": 1194.5259999999998, "end": 1195.5259999999998, "text": "Haven't you been to the library?"}, {"start": 1195.5259999999998, "end": 1196.5259999999998, "text": "I'm working my way there."}, {"start": 1200.5259999999998, "end": 1202.5259999999998, "text": "Oh, you can just put that anywhere."}, {"start": 1205.1859999999997, "end": 1207.1859999999997, "text": "Doing anything fun for the summer?"}, {"start": 1209.946, "end": 1210.946, "text": "No plans."}, {"start": 1210.946, "end": 1211.946, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 1211.946, "end": 1212.946, "text": "Cool, cool, cool."}, {"start": 1213.946, "end": 1214.946, "text": "Slippery."}, {"start": 1222.1319999999998, "end": 1224.712, "text": "(upbeat music)"}]}